  "title": "The Commandments — Prayer, Fasting and Giving",
  "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"720px\"},\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"2.5rem\",\"bottom\":\"4rem\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-top:2.5rem;padding-bottom:4rem\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1,\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#b3261e\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#b3261e\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontStyle\":\"normal\",\"fontWeight\":\"400\",\"fontSize\":\"2.6rem\"}}} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#b3261e;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:2.6rem\">Prayer, Fasting and Giving</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"/instructions/\">Read Instructions</a> · <a href=\"/instructions/instructions-index/\">Instructions index</a> · <a href=\"/instructions/beyond-the-torah/\">Beyond the Torah</a> · <a href=\"/bible/law/the-commandments/individual-command-counting-method/\">Counting and classification guide</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This page preserves the numbered Christ studies and their quoted passages. <a href=\"/instructions/prayer-fasting-and-giving/\">Open the complementary Harmony study</a>. The two views serve different purposes; their entry counts are not added together.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Verified Saints Translation links.</strong> Biblical references open the Saints chapter at its exact verse anchor. Saints numbering appears first; corresponding KJV numbers are shown where they differ. Ranges open at their first verse. <a href=\"/bible/law/the-commandments/#citation-audit\">Read the citation and numbering notes</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"saints-pericope\"} -->\n<p class=\"saints-pericope\">The Commandments of Christ · His own commandments: before the Father · 64–73</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><a href=\"/bible/law/the-commandments/christ-love-mercy-forgiveness/\">← Love, Mercy and Forgiveness</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href=\"/bible/law/the-commandments/#part-two\">The Commandments of Christ: all subjects</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href=\"/bible/law/the-commandments/christ-treasure-trust-watchfulness/\">Treasure, Trust and Watchfulness →</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#3e3e3e\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#3e3e3e\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"17px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#3e3e3e;font-size:17px\">The hidden life: alms, prayer and fasting done for the Father who sees in secret, and the prayer He gave.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#3e3e3e\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#3e3e3e\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"16px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#3e3e3e;font-size:16px\"><strong>On this page:</strong> <a href=\"#t4-1\">In Secret</a> · <a href=\"#t4-2\">Pray in This Way</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2,\"className\":\"saints-section\",\"anchor\":\"t4-1\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading saints-section\" id=\"t4-1\">In Secret</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k64\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k64\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>64.</strong> To give alms in secret.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Take care not to practice your righteousness before people in order to be seen by them; otherwise you have no reward with your Father in the heavens.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">So when you give alms, do not sound a trumpet before you as the hypocrites do in the synagogues and streets, so that people may glorify them. Truly I tell you, they have received their reward in full.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">But when you give alms, do not let your left hand know what your right hand is doing,</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">so that your almsgiving may be in secret; and your Father who sees in secret will repay you.</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-6/#v6-1\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 6:1–4\">Matthew 6:1–4</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>In the Law:</strong> <a href=\"/instructions/#study-132\">132. Opening the hand to a poor neighbor</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k65\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k65\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>65.</strong> To pray in secret, and not to babble as the nations do.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">And when you pray, you shall not be like the hypocrites, because they love to pray standing in synagogues and at street corners, so that people may see them. Truly I tell you, they have received their reward in full.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">But you, when you pray, enter your inner room, shut your door, and pray to your Father who is in secret; and your Father who sees in secret will repay you.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">When praying, do not babble like the Gentiles, for they think they will be heard through their many words.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">So do not become like them, for your Father knows what you need before you ask Him.</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-6/#v6-5\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 6:5–8\">Matthew 6:5–8</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>In the Law:</strong> <a href=\"/instructions/#study-54\">54. Serving the Lord</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k66\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k66\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>66.</strong> To fast in secret.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">And when you fast, do not become gloomy like the hypocrites, for they disfigure their faces so that people may see they are fasting. Truly I tell you, they have received their reward in full.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">But you, when fasting, anoint your head and wash your face,</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">so that your fasting may be seen by your Father who is in secret, rather than by people; and your Father who sees in secret will repay you.</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-6/#v6-16\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 6:16–18\">Matthew 6:16–18</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2,\"className\":\"saints-section\",\"anchor\":\"t4-2\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading saints-section\" id=\"t4-2\">Pray in This Way</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k67\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k67\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>67.</strong> The prayer He gave: Our Father.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Pray, then, in this way: ‘Our Father who art in the heavens, hallowed be Thy name.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Thy kingdom come; Thy will be done, as in heaven, so also upon earth.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Give us this day our daily bread;</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">and forgive us our debts, as we also have forgiven our debtors;</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">and bring us not into temptation, but deliver us from evil.’</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-6/#v6-9\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 6:9–13\">Matthew 6:9–13</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=\"/bible/salvation/luke/chapter-11/#v11-2\" title=\"Saints Translation — Luke 11:2–4\">Luke 11:2–4</a><br><strong>In the Law:</strong> <a href=\"/instructions/#study-54\">54. Serving the Lord</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k68\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k68\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>68.</strong> To ask, to seek, to knock.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Ask, and it will be given to you; seek, and you will find; knock, and it will be opened to you.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">For everyone who asks receives, the one who seeks finds, and to the one who knocks it will be opened.</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-7/#v7-7\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 7:7–8\">Matthew 7:7–8</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=\"/bible/salvation/luke/chapter-11/#v11-9\" title=\"Saints Translation — Luke 11:9–10\">Luke 11:9–10</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k69\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k69\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>69.</strong> Always to pray and not lose heart.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>And He told them a parable about their need to pray always and not lose heart, … <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">And will not God bring about justice for His chosen ones who cry to Him day and night? And will He delay over them?</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">I tell you, He will bring about justice for them speedily. Nevertheless, when the Son of Man comes, will He find faith on the earth?”</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/luke/chapter-18/#v18-1\" title=\"Saints Translation — Luke 18:1\">Luke 18:1</a> · <a href=\"/bible/salvation/luke/chapter-18/#v18-7\" title=\"Saints Translation — Luke 18:7–8\">Luke 18:7–8</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k70\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k70\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>70.</strong> To ask the Father in His name.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">And on that day you will ask Me nothing. Amen, amen, I say to you: if you ask the Father anything, He will give it to you in My name.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Until now you have asked nothing in My name. Ask, and you will receive, so that your joy may be made full.</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/john/chapter-16/#v16-23\" title=\"Saints Translation — John 16:23–24\">John 16:23–24</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=\"/bible/salvation/john/chapter-14/#v14-13\" title=\"Saints Translation — John 14:13–14\">John 14:13–14</a> · <a href=\"/bible/salvation/john/chapter-15/#v15-16\" title=\"Saints Translation — John 15:16\">John 15:16</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k71\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k71\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>71.</strong> To have faith in God: to believe that you have received what you ask.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Jesus answered them, <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">“Have faith in God.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Truly I tell you, whoever says to this mountain, ‘Be lifted up and thrown into the sea,’ and does not doubt in his heart, but believes that what he says is happening, it will be his.</mark> <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Therefore I tell you, everything you pray and ask for—believe that you have received it, and it will be yours.</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/mark/chapter-11/#v11-22\" title=\"Saints Translation — Mark 11:22–24\">Mark 11:22–24</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-21/#v21-21\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 21:21–22\">Matthew 21:21–22</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k72\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k72\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>72.</strong> To petition the Lord of the harvest to send out workers.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>He said to them, <mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">“The harvest is plentiful, but the workers are few. Therefore petition the Lord of the harvest to send workers out into His harvest.</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/luke/chapter-10/#v10-2\" title=\"Saints Translation — Luke 10:2\">Luke 10:2</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-9/#v9-37\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 9:37–38\">Matthew 9:37–38</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"saints-command-card\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"width\":\"1px\",\"style\":\"solid\",\"radius\":\"8px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"borderColor\":\"cyan-bluish-gray\",\"backgroundColor\":\"white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group saints-command-card has-border-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-border-color has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1f1f1f\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"18px\"}},\"anchor\":\"k73\",\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color has-link-color\" id=\"k73\" style=\"color:#1f1f1f;font-size:18px\"><strong>73.</strong> To keep watch and pray that you may not enter temptation.</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#b3261e\" class=\"has-inline-color\">Keep watch and pray, so that you may not enter temptation. The spirit indeed is willing, but the flesh is weak.”</mark></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite><a href=\"/bible/salvation/matthew/chapter-26/#v26-41\" title=\"Saints Translation — Matthew 26:41\">Matthew 26:41</a></cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><strong>See also:</strong> <a href=\"/bible/salvation/mark/chapter-14/#v14-38\" title=\"Saints Translation — Mark 14:38\">Mark 14:38</a> · <a href=\"/bible/salvation/luke/chapter-22/#v22-40\" title=\"Saints Translation — Luke 22:40\">Luke 22:40</a> · <a href=\"/bible/salvation/luke/chapter-22/#v22-46\" title=\"Saints Translation — Luke 22:46\">Luke 22:46</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-wide\"} -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity is-style-wide\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#6b6b6b\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"15px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#6b6b6b;font-size:15px\"><a href=\"/bible/law/the-commandments/christ-love-mercy-forgiveness/\">← Love, Mercy and Forgiveness</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href=\"/bible/law/the-commandments/#part-two\">The Commandments of Christ: all subjects</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href=\"/bible/law/the-commandments/christ-treasure-trust-watchfulness/\">Treasure, Trust and Watchfulness →</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#8a8a8a\"},\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#8a8a8a\"}}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"14px\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color has-link-color\" style=\"color:#8a8a8a;font-size:14px\">Saints Translation · The Commandments of Christ · gathered from His own words in the four Gospels; statements in our own words; passages quoted from the Saints Translation with His words in red · working draft awaiting specialist review.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->"
}
